{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"purpose","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This package unifies the shared ESLint config used across all TanStack projects. It is designed to be framework-agnostic, and does not include any framework-specific plugins."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To install the package, run the following command:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-config","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"package-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"package.json"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Make sure you have ESLint v9+ installed"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"eslint-config-js","children":[{"type":"text","value":"eslint.config.js"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { tanstackConfig } from '@tanstack/eslint-config'\n\nexport default [\n  ...tanstackConfig,\n  {\n    // Custom rules go here\n  },\n]","lang":"js"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"plugins","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plugins"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@eslint/js"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - The core ESLint rules"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint","children":[{"type":"text","value":"typescript-eslint"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Enables TypeScript support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/un-ts/eslint-plugin-import-x","children":[{"type":"text","value":"eslint-plugin-import-x"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Lints imports and exports"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/eslint-community/eslint-plugin-n","children":[{"type":"text","value":"eslint-plugin-n"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Useful rules for Node.js"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rules","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rules"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can inspect the enabled rules by running "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pnpm dlx @eslint/config-inspector"},{"type":"text","value":", or by browsing the source "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/config/tree/main/packages/eslint-config","children":[{"type":"text","value":"here"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Each rule has a comment explaining why it is included in the shared config."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"purpose","text":"Purpose","level":2},{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"setup","text":"Setup","level":2},{"id":"package-json","text":"package.json","level":3},{"id":"eslint-config-js","text":"eslint.config.js","level":3},{"id":"plugins","text":"Plugins","level":2},{"id":"rules","text":"Rules","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Purpose\n\nThis package unifies the shared ESLint config used across all TanStack projects. It is designed to be framework-agnostic, and does not include any framework-specific plugins.\n\n## Installation\n\nTo install the package, run the following command:\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-config\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n### package.json\n\n- Make sure you have ESLint v9+ installed\n\n### eslint.config.js\n\n```js\nimport { tanstackConfig } from '@tanstack/eslint-config'\n\nexport default [\n  ...tanstackConfig,\n  {\n    // Custom rules go here\n  },\n]\n```\n\n## Plugins\n\n- [@eslint/js](https://github.com/eslint/eslint) - The core ESLint rules\n- [typescript-eslint](https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) - Enables TypeScript support\n- [eslint-plugin-import-x](https://github.com/un-ts/eslint-plugin-import-x) - Lints imports and exports\n- [eslint-plugin-n](https://github.com/eslint-community/eslint-plugin-n) - Useful rules for Node.js\n\n## Rules\n\nYou can inspect the enabled rules by running `pnpm dlx @eslint/config-inspector`, or by browsing the source [here](https://github.com/TanStack/config/tree/main/packages/eslint-config). Each rule has a comment explaining why it is included in the shared config.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: eslint\ntitle: ESLint\n---\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis package unifies the shared ESLint config used across all TanStack projects. It is designed to be framework-agnostic, and does not include any framework-specific plugins.\n\n## Installation\n\nTo install the package, run the following command:\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-config\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n### package.json\n\n- Make sure you have ESLint v9+ installed\n\n### eslint.config.js\n\n```js\nimport { tanstackConfig } from '@tanstack/eslint-config'\n\nexport default [\n  ...tanstackConfig,\n  {\n    // Custom rules go here\n  },\n]\n```\n\n## Plugins\n\n- [@eslint/js](https://github.com/eslint/eslint) - The core ESLint rules\n- [typescript-eslint](https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) - Enables TypeScript support\n- [eslint-plugin-import-x](https://github.com/un-ts/eslint-plugin-import-x) - Lints imports and exports\n- [eslint-plugin-n](https://github.com/eslint-community/eslint-plugin-n) - Useful rules for Node.js\n\n## Rules\n\nYou can inspect the enabled rules by running `pnpm dlx @eslint/config-inspector`, or by browsing the source [here](https://github.com/TanStack/config/tree/main/packages/eslint-config). Each rule has a comment explaining why it is included in the shared config.\n"}
